      "quote": null,
      "reason": "Although the review concerns an intervention (MSCs/secretome), the evidence does not provide planned comparisons framed using PICO or a variant; no explicit statement of comparator, population details, outcomes, or specific intervention comparisons was found in the retrieved text."
    }
